    "body": "Label note (M3): I moved this from `merge-ready` to `needs-maintainer`. The review found no blockers, but two of its notes change posted output for existing Heidenhain users, and those are the owner's call:\n- explicit `G54..G59` now posts as `G247 Q339=1..6`, a house mapping that also resets transformations;\n- G205 pecks with `Q202 = Q205 = Q257 = peck`, which may retract fully each peck where the old chain retracted 1 mm.\n\nNeither has run on a TNC control or simulator yet. Thanks @seelesturm for the well-cited cycles.",
